{# To each active owner and manager but the requester when a shift change request is submitted
   (#84). Context: firstName, requesterName, organizationName, kind ("missing_shift" | "new_times"),
   startedAt, endedAt (null: the shift stays open), shiftStartedAt, shiftEndedAt (the shift's times
   now, for new times), note, timeZone, link. Times are already formatted in the organization's time
   zone. Rendered by the queue worker (adr/0012). #}
<p>Hello {{ firstName }},</p>
{% if kind == 'missing_shift' %}
<p>{{ requesterName }} asks you to enter a shift they worked but did not clock in <strong>{{ organizationName }}</strong>:</p>
<p>{{ startedAt }} to {{ endedAt }}</p>
{% else %}
<p>{{ requesterName }} asks you to change the times of one of their shifts in <strong>{{ organizationName }}</strong>:</p>
<p>Now: {{ shiftStartedAt ?? 'unknown' }} to {{ shiftEndedAt ?? 'still open' }}<br>
Asked for: {{ startedAt }} to {{ endedAt ?? 'still open' }}</p>
{% endif %}
<p>Times are in {{ timeZone }}. Their note: <em>{{ note }}</em></p>
<p>Approve or reject the request in the admin panel:</p>
<p><a href="{{ link }}">Open the admin panel</a></p>
